msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:95 1171b83cdae54f9eb0c9f5c1ff48c6cc
msgid ""
"Now you can test by locking the screen with ``ctrl`` + ``alt`` + ``l`` . If "
"it was successful and you are pleased with the results, restart your "
"computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:97 8014f41d1f9646898eca9ac4099c18f2
msgid ""
"**Note**: When logging in. the first thing you put is the TOTP secret and "
"then the password. This is true in the screen locker and as well as the "
"session manager (the login window that shows right after you put the disk "
"encryption passphrase)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:99 7a38d50845724632a06da453197af5ab
msgid ""
"After this is done, its recommended to do a backup. This is because as long "
"as you incude dom0 in the backup, your authentication code will be backed up "
