#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:215 0e76246af0f448698428bdd7ee297ba5
msgid ""
"Configure your YubiKey for challenge-response ``HMAC-SHA1`` mode. This can "
"be done on any qube, e.g. a disposable (you need to :doc:`attach the YubiKey "
"</user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-usb-devices>` to this app qube though) or "
"directly on the sys-usb vm. You need to (temporarily) install the package "
"“yubikey-personalization-gui” and run it by typing ``yubikey-personalization-"
"gui`` in the command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:217 533942bb481f4a448e19d30bfd665eb2
msgid "In the program go to ``Challenge-Response``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:219 44934ab6be72499a89266c668758b7cf
msgid "select ``HMAC-SHA1``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:221 dbd0ddb3592d41fb820ccce817d9d29d
